# collet repository visibility and local generated files.
# Keep the runtime, templates, catalogues, tests, eval cases and public documentation visible.

# Private working material and documentation
.private/
docs/tasks/
docs/decisions/
docs/knowledge/private/
docs/apis/private/

# Machine-local agent state; shared instructions stay visible
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/memory/
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.override.md

# Local planning and session state written at run time, never published
.foreman/
ROADMAP.jsonl

# Dependency cache and operating-system metadata
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
